<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Resume - Font and Colour</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f4f8;
            color: #333333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .resume {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background-color: white;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #1e40af;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #1e40af;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2563eb;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        h3 {
            color: #374151;
        }

        p, li {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .contact {
            color: #e0e7ff;
        }

        .highlight {
            color: #059669;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        a {
            color: #2563eb;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #666666;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="resume">

        <header>
            <h1>Mukesh</h1>
            <p class="contact">
                Email: mukesh@example.com |
                Phone: +91 9876543210
            </p>
            <p class="contact">Bareilly, Uttar Pradesh, India</p>
        </header>

        <main>
            <section>
                <h2>Career Objective</h2>
                <p>
                    To build a successful career in software development
                    and use my technical skills to solve real-world problems.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Education</h2>
                <h3>Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</h3>
                <p class="highlight">Currently Pursuing</p>
                <p>Class 12th - Completed</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>HTML and CSS</li>
                    <li>Java</li>
                    <li>JavaScript</li>
                    <li>Python</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Projects</h2>
                <h3>Personal Portfolio</h3>
                <p>Created a personal webpage using HTML and CSS.</p>

                <h3>Resume Webpage</h3>
                <p>Designed a resume using HTML and CSS styling.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Strengths</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Quick Learner</li>
                    <li>Problem Solving</li>
                    <li>Teamwork</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Hobbies</h2>
                <p>Travelling, coding, and exploring mountains.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Declaration</h2>
                <p>
                    I declare that the information provided above
                    is true to the best of my knowledge.
                </p>
            </section>
        </main>

        <footer>
            <p>&copy; 2026 Mukesh. All rights reserved.</p>
        </footer>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
